    "note": "**Pinned input correction.** The bundled FASTQ schema is a stale template. The pinned checker requires the six columns below in this exact order. Input data may be FASTQ, BAM or a FAST5 directory; `fasta` may be a local reference path or a configured genome key. Empty optional cells retain their place in the CSV header. Write the sheet explicitly and review barcode, replicate and reference assignments.",
